x}_{2} & =0 \\\\ 10{y}_{1}^{2}+2\\sqrt{10}(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}{y}_{1}+\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}{y}_{2})-6\\sqrt{10}(\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}{y}_{1}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}{y}_{2}) & =0 \\\\ 10{y}_{1}^{2}-20{y}_{1} & =0 \\\\ {y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{1} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we complete the square for the variable ${y}_{1}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{1} & =0 \\\\ ({y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{1}+1)-1 & =0 \\\\ {({y}_{1}-1)}^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ {({y}_{1}-1)}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, performing the change of variables\n\n$$\n{z}_{1}={y}_{1}-1,\n$$\n\nwe get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{1}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich represents the pair of parallel lines  ${z}_{1}=1$ and ${z}_{1}=-1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404810 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404811 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404812 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404813 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186404814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404809 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "394f4d35-8eb9-5319-8076-2545b5e06b52" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404810 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbola with semiaxes $1$ and $1$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404810 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404810 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4c75de21-c317-5237-86ad-e88e440edb77" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404811 #edb/ref 1080 "A pair of intersecting lines" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404811 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404811 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "84aa3f18-3554-54fd-ae6f-b39ef7e2bffa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218